# The edge's routes in this composition: each module by its name, which is the
# audience the edge asks the authority for, its REST face (/v1/<module>/…), its
# Connect face (/<package.Service>/…) and the RPC services that face serves.
# The run resolves each reference. Each face dials the hop in front of the
# module, so the edge only routes; the hop checks. No frontend here: this
# workspace composes no page behind the edge.
MODULES=documents,records
DOCUMENTS_REST=${endpoint:documents/documents/rest}
DOCUMENTS_CONNECT=${endpoint:documents/documents/connect}
DOCUMENTS_RPC=documents.v1.DocumentsService
RECORDS_REST=${endpoint:records/records/rest}
RECORDS_CONNECT=${endpoint:records/records/connect}
RECORDS_RPC=records.v1.RecordsService
